# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Static dispersed obstacle field for Primitive A / AB priority testing.
# The start zone remains clear; the nearest object is ~0.27 m from the robot.
# Objects are deliberately matte/non-emissive so they do not become light sources.
# Primitive B ignores proximity, Primitive A ignores light, AB receives both.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
